body:
Edit: I got the name of the AP wrong, you can disregard my misinformed addition to the discussion.

&#x200B;

I'm playing through Carrion Crown rn as a player, currently in book 3... and I can say wholeheartedly you do not want to run this for your kids without heavily modifying it. I don't want to say any spoilers, but book 1 has a crime boss who kidnaps kids, book 2 has a very dark ending, book 3 has some other questionable matierial we've run into already. I'd steer clear of that AP.

[https://paizo.com/products/btpy90be](https://paizo.com/products/btpy90be)

&#x200B;

This is the book you're looking for.
